  "description": "THE ULTIMATE BREAKOUT BEGINS!\nYou’ve got a report card full of low grades, angry parents, and a strict punishment: you are grounded. But your friends are waiting outside, and you aren't about to let a locked door stop the fun.\n\nSchoolboy Escape: Runaway is a first-person stealth puzzle game where your only goal is freedom. Use your wits to navigate through the house, dodge your patrolling parents, and find the way out.\n\nGAMEPLAY FEATURES.\nSTEALTH IS KEY: Tiptoe across quiet hallways and avoid making noise. If your parents hear you running, you’re busted!\n\nMASTER OF DISGUISE: Mom checking in on you? trick her by quickly placing a math book on your desk to pretend you’re studying hard.\n\nSOLVE THE PUZZLE: The front door isn't the only obstacle. Search drawers, cupboards, and shelves to find hidden keys, spare parts, and codes to crack the safe in your parents' bedroom.\n\nEXPAND YOUR ESCAPE: The adventure doesn't stop at the front door. Face new challenges in the school, the village, and beyond as you sneak past watchmen and obstacles.\n\nDO YOU HAVE WHAT IT TAKES?\nEvery move counts. Watch your surroundings, hide in closets when necessary, and collect every tool you can find. Can you escape the house before your parents catch you?\n\nPlan your route. Fool your parents. Run away!",
